  <ul>
    <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Site or the services it depends on.</li>
    <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Site or its systems.</li>
    <li>Use the Site's forms to send spam, false information, or content that is harmful or unlawful.</li>
    <li>Pretend to be another person or organization.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The text, logo, flyers, and photographs on the Site, including photographs from our events, belong to the Mission or
    are used with permission. You may view the Site and share links to it, and you may share our posts on social media.
