    will review it.
  </p>
  <p>
    We make no statement about whether a gift is tax-deductible. Please speak with your own tax adviser.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Information you submit</h2>
  <p>
    When you send us information through the Site's forms, you confirm that it is accurate and that you have the right
    to share it. You allow us to use it to respond to you and to run the programs you ask to join, as described in our
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. We will not publish what you submit without your permission.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Third-party links and services</h2>
  <p>
    The Site links to and embeds services we do not control, including Google Forms, Facebook, Instagram, and YouTube. We
    are not responsible for their content, availability, or practices. Your use of them is governed by their own terms.
