    financial, or other professional advice.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, the Mission and its officers, volunteers, and representatives are not liable
    for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site, or for any loss
    caused by content or services from third parties.
  </p>

