  <p>
    These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, United States, without regard to its conflict-of-law
    rules. Any dispute will be brought in the state or federal courts located in Georgia.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Changes to these Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these Terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page shows when they last
    changed. Continuing to use the Site after a change means you accept the updated Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these Terms:<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
